    "text": "Consider the following reversible chemical reactions:<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mrow><mo>&#8652;</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> .....(1) <math><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mrow><mo>&#8652;</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mover><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> .....(2)<br /><br />The relation between <math><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is:"
  },
